Use code with caution.Invoke the site documentation engine to bind and convert the metrics into static files:bashmvn site
Use code with caution.Locate the results inside your directory path:Main Portal: target/site/index.htmlTest Log Report: target/site/surefire-report.htmlOpen the index.html file using any web browser to view the side menu and generated project metrics tabs.

